      "content": "Wait, 3.2% conversion? I'm looking at the preliminary sales report right now and the conversion is closer to 0.5%. If I go to the CFO with 3.2% and they see the actual revenue numbers, they'll rip me apart.\n\nAre you sure you aren't seeing different data? I need to know the *exact* truth here before I commit to these numbers in the board deck. Was the campaign actually as effective as those engagement numbers look, or are we just getting a lot of likes without the sales?",
